flowchart LR
    Camera[Camera frames] --> Hidden[Hidden processing canvas]
    Hidden --> Pixels[RGBA pixel data]
    Pixels --> Smooth[Previous-frame smoothing]
    Smooth --> Brightness[Brightness, contrast, gain]
    Brightness --> Mapping[Density map lookup]
    Mapping --> Visible[Visible ASCII canvas]
    Visible --> Download[PNG download]
    Visible --> ImageData[PNG data URL on analysis]
    ImageData --> Gemini[Google Gemini service]
    Gemini --> Result[JSON description, threatLevel, tags]
    Result --> Modal[Analysis modal]
